<title>UK: Jeyes surge on newspaper recommendation.</title>
<headline>Jeyes surge on newspaper recommendation.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Jeyes Group Plc rose on Monday after a &quot;buy&quot; recommendation in the Sunday Telegraph, traders said.</p>
<p>Shares in the lavatory cleaning products producer were up 16-1/2p at 122p by 1200 GMT.</p>
